y  progress on that prisoner exchange for  brittany griner and paul whalen  she's still wrongfully detained as is  paul whalen she shouldn't have to be  sitting and going through at trial we're  going to stay focused on making sure we  can get her home we're working on this  literally every day i don't want to go  into the details of the proposal but we  did make a serious proposal to the  russians they have not accepted that we  urge them to accept that because it is  serious and it will help bring paul  and brittany home back to their families  where they belong but i can assure you  that president biden and his entire team  is focused on that every single day  so so admiral have they responded at all  or is the ball still in their court  there is uh there are discussions going  on between both sides  we've made a serious proposal we urge  the russians to act on that proposal  admiral john kirby thank you very much  for appearing with us we appreciate it  my pleasure thanks vlad
 

